 way to freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Morphing Megastructures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The living architecture has a mind of its own, and constantly reconfigures itself to throw new, dynamic challenges your way. You'll need both force and cunning to outwit its cruel designs.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Syncretic Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217790/373860c8d47b480c9065066041d65260301dd0ba/header.jpg?t=1757364321","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024 Syncretic Games LLC. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2217790/748115/79658cb94c8f1f1f9f5e9c4a7c0050f14dbf2862/1751091339/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744920560","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2217790/748115/79658cb94c8f1f1f9f5e9c4a7c0050f14dbf2862/1751091339/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744920560","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2217790/748115/79658cb94c8f1f1f9f5e9c4a7c0050f14dbf2862/1751091339/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744920560","id":257050671,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050671/movie480.mp4?t=1744920560","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050671/movie_max.mp4?t=1744920560"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257050671/5c2e201eab3b51d3e277194b7d0c76a323380669/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744920560","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050671/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744920560","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050671/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744920560"}}],"name":"Cathexis","package_groups":[],"pc